2026-01-23 05:37:16.376 | DEBUG    | Processing tool event with attributes: {'gen_ai.tool.name': 'open_files', 'gen_ai.tool.call.id': 'toolu_bdrk_01NzfMi1Ay1MhQn5FgKSeAZe', 'tool_arguments': '{"file_paths": ["memory-bank/README.md","memory-bank/recentUpdates.md","memory-bank/progress.md","memory-bank/systemPatterns.md"]}', 'logfire.msg': 'running tool: open_files', 'logfire.json_schema': '{"type": "object", "properties": {"tool_arguments": {"type": "object"}, "tool_response": {"type": "object"}, "gen_ai.tool.name": {}, "gen_ai.tool.call.id": {}}}', 'logfire.span_type': 'span', 'tool_response': '["Successfully opened memory-bank/README.md:\\n\\n````markdown\\n   0 # Arkan Project Memory Bank\\n...\\n 133 📋 RAG system for context retrieval  \\n...\\n 271 | Area | Score | Status |\\n...\\n 297 \\n````","Successfully opened memory-bank/recentUpdates.md:\\n\\n````markdown\\n   0 # Recent Updates - Arkan\\n...\\n   8 ## Week of January 20-26, 2026\\n   9 \\n  10 ### ✅ January 23, 2026 - Unified AI Generation Flow + Cleanup\\n  11 \\n  12 **Impact:** HIGH - Single API for All Text Generation  \\n  13 **Status:** Complete  \\n  14 **Priority:** P1\\n  15 \\n  16 #### Overview\\n  17 Created a unified AI generation system where ANY feature can generate text using a single API and flow. Then cleaned up all deprecated files from previous implementations.\\n  18 \\n  19 #### Unified Flow Implementation\\n  20 \\n  21 **Key Achievement:** One API endpoint, one AI flow, one schema for all generation tasks.\\n  22 \\n  23 **Process Types Supported (8):**\\n  24 - Section generation\\n  25 - Grammar correction\\n  26 - Translation\\n  27 - Summarization\\n  28 - Text expansion\\n  29 - Rewriting\\n  30 - Chat/conversation\\n  31 - Custom generation\\n  32 \\n  33 **Files Created (7):**\\n  34 - `src/ai/schemas/unified-generation.ts` - Unified schema & types\\n  35 - `src/ai/flows/generate-unified.ts` - Single AI flow for all tasks\\n  36 - `src/app/api/generate/route.ts` - Unified API endpoint\\n  37 - `src/services/api/unifiedGenerationService.ts` - Helper functions\\n  38 - `src/ai/flows/__tests__/generate-unified.test.ts` - 50+ tests\\n  39 - `docs/UNIFIED_GENERATION_FLOW.md` - Complete documentation (500+ lines)\\n  40 \\n  41 **Architecture:**\\n  42 ```\\n  43 Before: Multiple routes, flows, schemas (complex)\\n  44 After: One route, one flow, one schema (simple)\\n  45 ```\\n  46 \\n  47 **Benefits:**\\n  48 - Single API endpoint: `POST /api/generate`\\n  49 - 8 process types supported\\n  50 - Automatic model selection per type\\n  51 - Built-in auth, credits, rate limiting, retry\\n  52 - Add new features in minutes (just write prompts)\\n  53 \\n  54 #### Cleanup of Deprecated Files\\n  55 \\n  56 **Files Deleted (8):**\\n  57 - `src/ai/flows/generate-report-section.ts` (old complex schema)\\n  58 - `src/ai/flows/generate-section-simplified.ts` (old 3-field schema)\\n  59 - `src/app/api/generate/section/route.ts` (replaced by unified)\\n  60 - `src/app/api/generate/section/__tests__/route.test.ts`\\n  61 - `src/ai/schemas/simplified-flows.ts`\\n  62 - `src/services/api/reportService.ts`\\n  63 - `src/ai/flows/__tests__/generate-section-simplified.test.ts`\\n  64 - `src/ai/flows/__tests__/generate-section-plain-text.test.ts`\\n  65 \\n  66 **References Updated (4):**\\n  67 - `src/hooks/report-mode/use-ai-actions.ts` - Uses unified flow\\n  68 - `src/types/index.ts` - Removed old exports\\n  69 - `src/types/generation.ts` - Commented old imports\\n  70 - `src/ai/dev.ts` - Updated flow imports\\n  71 \\n  72 **Cleanup Results:**\\n  73 - 8 files deleted\\n  74 - 4 files updated\\n  75 - ~2,000+ lines removed\\n  76 - 0 broken imports\\n  77 - System uses unified flow exclusively\\n  78 \\n  79 #### Impact Summary\\n  80 \\n  81 | Metric | Before | After | Change |\\n  82 |--------|--------|-------|--------|\\n  83 | API Endpoints | Multiple | 1 | Unified |\\n  84 | AI Flows | 2+ | 1 | -50%+ |\\n  85 | Schemas | 2+ | 1 | Simplified |\\n  86 | Files | 8 extra | Removed | Cleaner |\\n  87 | Add Feature Time | Hours | Minutes | Faster |\\n  88 \\n  89 #### Usage Example\\n  90 \\n  91 **Before (Complex):**\\n  92 ```typescript\\n  93 POST /api/generate/section\\n  94 Body: { ...14 fields }\\n  95 ```\\n  96 \\n  97 **After (Simple):**\\n  98 ```typescript\\n  99 POST /api/generate\\n 100 Body: {\\n 101   processType: \'section\',\\n 102   processId: \'intro\',\\n 103   systemPrompt: \'...\',\\n 104   userPrompt: \'...\'\\n 105 }\\n 106 ```\\n 107 \\n 108 **For any new feature:** Just prepare prompts and call unified API!\\n 109 \\n 110 **Documentation:** `docs/UNIFIED_GENERATION_FLOW.md`\\n 111 \\n 112 ---\\n 113 \\n 114 ### ✅ January 23, 2026 - Gemma 2B JSON Output Issue Fixed\\n 115 \\n 116 **Impact:** CRITICAL - Fixed generation failures with small models  \\n 117 **Status:** Complete  \\n 118 **Priority:** P0\\n 119 \\n 120 #### Problem\\n 121 Ollama Gemma 2b model was failing with schema validation errors:\\n 122 - Error: \\"Schema validation failed - must have required property \'sectionId\'\\"\\n 123 - Model was returning schema definitions instead of actual content\\n 124 - Success rate: Only 30%\\n 125 - Blocked users from using the fastest/smallest model\\n 126 \\n 127 #### Root Cause\\n 128 Small models (2B parameters) struggle with structured JSON output. When asked to generate JSON following a schema, they:\\n 129 - Return the schema definition itself\\n 130 - Generate malformed JSON\\n 131 - Include metadata instead of content\\n 132 - Have limited instruction-following for structured formats\\n 133 \\n 134 #### Solution Implemented\\n 135 ✅ **Removed output schema from AI flow**\\n 136 - Let models generate plain markdown text instead of JSON\\n 137 - No schema validation required from model output\\n 138 \\n 139 ✅ **Enhanced response parsing**\\n 140 - Handles 7+ different response formats\\n 141 - Extracts content from: text, content, output, response, message fields\\n 142 - Supports candidates array format\\n 143 - Robust fallback strategies\\n 144 \\n 145 ✅ **Updated prompts**\\n 146 - Added explicit \\"plain text only\\" instructions\\n 147 - \\"Do NOT wrap output in JSON, XML, or any other format\\"\\n 148 - \\"Return pure markdown text only\\"\\n 149 \\n 150 ✅ **Added comprehensive tests**\\n 151 - 20 new tests for plain text generation\\n 152 - Tests for various response formats\\n 153 - Edge cases and error handling\\n 154 \\n 155 #### Results\\n 156 | Metric | Before | After | Improvement |\\n 157 |--------|--------|-------|-------------|\\n 158 | Success Rate (Gemma 2b) | 30% | 95% | **+217%** |\\n 159 | Generation Errors | Frequent | Rare | **-90%** |\\n 160 | Content Quality | Poor | Good | Much better |\\n 161 | Retry Attempts | 2-3 avg | 1 (rare) | **-70%** |\\n 162 \\n 163 #### Files Changed\\n 164 - Modified (3):\\n 165   - `src/ai/flows/generate-section-simplified.ts` - Removed output schema\\n 166   - `src/lib/prompt-builder.ts` - Added plain text instructions\\n 167   - Enhanced response parsing logic\\n 168 \\n 169 - Created (2):\\n 170   - `src/ai/flows/__tests__/generate-section-plain-text.test.ts` - 20 tests\\n 171   - `docs/FIX_GEMMA_JSON_OUTPUT.md` - Complete documentation\\n 172 \\n 173 #### Key Learning\\n 174 Small models excel at natural language generation but struggle with structured formats. Removing schema constraints allows models to do what they do best, dramatically improving success rates.\\n 175 \\n 176 ---\\n 177 \\n 178 ### ✅ January 23, 2026 - Simplified Generation Flow\\n 179 \\n 180 **Impact:** HIGH - Architectural Improvement  \\n 181 **Status:** Complete  \\n 182 **Priority:** P1\\n 183 \\n 184 #### Overview\\n 185 Refactored section generation flow to eliminate passing schema values to API/AI flow. All prompt construction now centralized in PromptBuilder.\\n 186 \\n 187 #### The Transformation\\n 188 \\n 189 **Before (14 fields):**\\n 190 ```typescript\\n 191 {\\n 192   sectionToGenerate, prompt, o