2026-01-23 05:48:50.604 | DEBUG    | Processing tool event with attributes: {'gen_ai.tool.name': 'find_and_replace_code', 'gen_ai.tool.call.id': 'toolu_bdrk_01Ru1M4gwaM6pnaL7j5E8j1w', 'tool_arguments': '{"file_path": "src/lib/models/section.ts", "find": "  /**\\n   * Mark section as successfully generated with AI model info\\n   */\\n  public markAsGenerated(aiModel: string, content: string): Section {", "replace": "  /**\\n   * Marks section as successfully generated by AI\\n   * \\n   * Updates status to GENERATED, stores AI model info, updates content statistics,\\n   * and saves previous version to history.\\n   * \\n   * @param aiModel - Name of AI model used (e.g., \'gemma-2b\', \'llama3-8b\')\\n   * @param content - Generated content\\n   * @returns New Section instance with updated content and metadata\\n   * \\n   * @example\\n   * ```typescript\\n   * const generated = section.markAsGenerated(\'gemma-2b\', \'AI generated content...\');\\n   * console.log(generated.getAiModel()); // \'gemma-2b\'\\n   * console.log(generated.getWordCount()); // calculated from content\\n   * ```\\n   */\\n  public markAsGenerated(aiModel: string, content: string): Section {"}', 'logfire.msg': 'running tool: find_and_replace_code', 'logfire.json_schema': '{"type": "object", "properties": {"tool_arguments": {"type": "object"}, "tool_response": {"type": "object"}, "gen_ai.tool.name": {}, "gen_ai.tool.call.id": {}}}', 'logfire.span_type': 'span'}
