ternalContext)\\n 510 - ✅ Proper deprecation warnings\\n 511 - ✅ Separated markdown export logic\\n 512 - ✅ Added validation helpers\\n 513 - ✅ Improved method naming\\n 514 - ✅ Fixed all broken tests\\n 515 - ✅ Added 31 new test cases\\n 516 - ✅ Optimized serialization\\n 517 - ✅ Zero regressions\\n 518 \\n 519 **New Files:**\\n 520 - `src/lib/project/markdown-exporter.ts` (198 lines)\\n 521 - `src/lib/models/project-validation.ts` (197 lines)\\n 522 - Test mocks for ESM compatibility\\n 523 \\n 524 **Quality Metrics:**\\n 525 - Architecture Score: 3.4/5 → 4.8/5 (+41%)\\n 526 - Test Count: 7 → 38 (+443%)\\n 527 - Coverage: 30% → 89.71% (+199%)\\n 528 - Documentation: 0% → 100%\\n 529 \\n 530 **Production Checklist:**\\n 531 - ✅ Type Safety (TypeScript + Zod)\\n 532 - ✅ Runtime Validation\\n 533 - ✅ Error Handling\\n 534 - ✅ Test Coverage (89.71%)\\n 535 - ✅ Documentation\\n 536 - ✅ Performance Optimized\\n 537 - ✅ Server Compatible\\n 538 - ✅ Security (Input Validation)\\n 539 \\n 540 ---\\n 541 \\n 542 ## Previous Completion Updates\\n 543 \\n...\\n 621 **Performance**:\\n...\\n 660 \\n````","Successfully opened memory-bank/systemPatterns.md:\\n\\n````markdown\\n   0 # System Patterns - Arkan\\n...\\n 139 **Flow-Based Generation:**\\n...\\n 287 **Cache Invalidation:**\\n...\\n 442 ### Model Best Practices\\n 443 \\n 444 **Immutable Class-Based Models:**\\n 445 ```typescript\\n 446 // Example: Project Model (Production-Ready Pattern)\\n 447 export class Project {\\n 448   // All properties readonly\\n 449   public readonly id: string;\\n 450   public readonly name: string;\\n 451   public readonly content: ProjectContent;\\n 452   \\n 453   constructor(props: ProjectProperties) {\\n 454     // Validation at entry point\\n 455     if (props.name !== undefined && props.name.trim() === \'\') {\\n 456       throw new ProjectValidationError(\'Project name cannot be empty\');\\n 457     }\\n 458     \\n 459     // Initialize with defaults\\n 460     this.id = props.id || uuidv4();\\n 461     this.name = props.name || \'Untitled Project\';\\n 462     \\n 463     // Validate content structure\\n 464     this.content = validateAndConvertContent(props.content);\\n 465   }\\n 466   \\n 467   // Immutable updates return new instances\\n 468   public with(props: Partial<ProjectProperties>): Project {\\n 469     return new Project({ ...this.toStateObject(), ...props });\\n 470   }\\n 471   \\n 472   // Business logic methods\\n 473   public addChapter(title: string): Project {\\n 474     const newChapter = new Chapter({ title, sections: [] });\\n 475     return this.with({ content: [...this.content, newChapter] });\\n 476   }\\n 477   \\n 478   // Serialization for persistence\\n 479   public toStateObject(): ProjectProperties {\\n 480     return { id: this.id, name: this.name, /* ... */ };\\n 481   }\\n 482 }\\n 483 ```\\n 484 \\n 485 **Model Validation Pattern:**\\n 486 ```typescript\\n 487 // Separate validation utilities\\n 488 // src/lib/models/project-validation.ts\\n 489 \\n 490 export const ProjectPropertiesSchema = z.object({\\n 491   name: z.string().min(1).max(200),\\n 492   complexity: z.number().min(0).max(100),\\n 493   // ... all fields validated\\n 494 });\\n 495 \\n 496 export class ProjectValidationError extends Error {\\n 497   constructor(\\n 498     message: string,\\n 499     public readonly field?: string,\\n 500     public readonly errors?: z.ZodError\\n 501   ) {\\n 502     super(message);\\n 503     this.name = \'ProjectValidationError\';\\n 504   }\\n 505 }\\n 506 \\n 507 export function validateProjectProperties(props: unknown) {\\n 508   try {\\n 509     return ProjectPropertiesSchema.parse(props);\\n 510   } catch (error) {\\n 511     throw new ProjectValidationError(/* ... */);\\n 512   }\\n 513 }\\n 514 ```\\n 515 \\n 516 **Documentation Standards:**\\n 517 ```typescript\\n 518 /**\\n 519  * Updates a section using an updater function\\n 520  * \\n 521  * @param id - Section ID to update\\n 522  * @param updater - Function that receives current section and returns updated section\\n 523  * @returns New Project instance with updated section, or same instance if not found\\n 524  * @throws {ProjectValidationError} If validation fails\\n 525  * \\n 526  * @example\\n 527  * ```typescript\\n 528  * const updated = project.updateSection(\'s-1\', section => \\n 529  *   section.with({ content: \'New content\' })\\n 530  * );\\n 531  * ```\\n 532  */\\n 533 public updateSection(id: string, updater: (s: Section) => Section): Project {\\n 534   // Implementation\\n 535 }\\n 536 ```\\n 537 \\n 538 **Testing Standards:**\\n 539 ```typescript\\n 540 // Comprehensive test coverage\\n 541 describe(\'Project Model\', () => {\\n 542   describe(\'constructor\', () => {\\n 543     it(\'should validate required fields\', () => {\\n 544       expect(() => new Project({ name: \'\' }))\\n 545         .toThrow(\'Project name cannot be empty\');\\n 546     });\\n 547   });\\n 548   \\n 549   describe(\'immutability\', () => {\\n 550     it(\'should return new instance on update\', () => {\\n 551       const original = new Project({ name: \'Original\' });\\n 552       const updated = original.with({ name: \'Updated\' });\\n 553       \\n 554       expect(updated).not.toBe(original);\\n 555       expect(original.name).toBe(\'Original\');\\n 556     });\\n 557   });\\n 558 });\\n 559 ```\\n 560 \\n 561 **Model Checklist:**\\n 562 - ✅ All properties `readonly`\\n 563 - ✅ Validation in constructor\\n 564 - ✅ Custom error classes\\n 565 - ✅ JSDoc on all public methods\\n 566 - ✅ Immutable update methods\\n 567 - ✅ `with()` method for partial updates\\n 568 - ✅ `toStateObject()` for serialization\\n 569 - ✅ Separate validation utilities\\n 570 - ✅ 70%+ test coverage\\n 571 - ✅ Works on client AND server\\n 572 \\n 573 **Anti-Patterns to Avoid:**\\n 574 - ❌ \'use client\' in models (prevents SSR)\\n 575 - ❌ Mutable properties\\n 576 - ❌ Silent failures (validate inputs)\\n 577 - ❌ Missing documentation\\n 578 - ❌ Mixing concerns (keep models pure)\\n 579 - ❌ Using array indices instead of IDs\\n 580 - ❌ Incomplete test coverage\\n 581 \\n 582 ---\\n 583 \\n...\\n 589 ### Behavioral Patterns\\n...\\n 621 \\n````"]'}
