2026-01-23 22:07:58.554 | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": "{\"plan\": \"# Dynamic Flows Feature Migration Plan\\n\\n## Overview\\nMove the Dynamic Flows feature from the Arkan project to a new standalone project with comprehensive UI components, maintaining all functionality and tests.\\n\\n## Key Files to Transfer\\n\\n### Core Dynamic Flow Library (`src/ai/dynamic-flow/`)\\n- **Core Modules:**\\n  - `executor.ts` - Main flow execution engine\\n  - `context-manager.ts` - Context management\\n  - `condition-evaluator.ts` - Condition evaluation logic\\n  - `step-executor.ts` - Step execution handler\\n  - `step-handlers.ts` - Step handling strategies\\n  - `schema-validator.ts` - Schema validation\\n  - `template-engine.ts` - Template processing\\n  - `index.ts` - Module exports\\n  - `example.ts` - Example implementations\\n\\n- **Tests:**\\n  - `__tests__/` - All test files (14 test files)\\n\\n- **Documentation:**\\n  - `README.md` - Feature documentation\\n  - `*_ENHANCEMENTS.md` - Enhancement guides\\n\\n### Flow Configuration & Models (`src/lib/models/` & `src/lib/cache/`)\\n- `flow-config.ts` - Flow configuration model\\n- `flow-config.test.ts` - Configuration tests\\n- `flow-config-cache.ts` - Caching mechanism\\n\\n### Flow Services (`src/services/`)\\n- `flow-config-service.ts` - Service implementation\\n- `flow-config-service.test.ts` - Service tests\\n\\n### Flow Schemas (`src/ai/schemas/`)\\n- `flows.ts` - Flow type definitions\\n\\n### Flow API Routes (`src/app/api/`)\\n- `admin/flows/` - Admin flow management endpoints\\n  - `route.ts` - Main admin endpoint\\n  - `[flowId]/route.ts` - Flow detail endpoint\\n  - `[flowId]/versions/route.ts` - Version management\\n  - `execute/route.ts` - Flow execution endpoint\\n- `flows/` - Public flow endpoints\\n  - `execute/route.ts` - Public execution\\n  - `test/route.ts` - Test endpoint\\n\\n### Flow Executors & Flows (`src/ai/flows/`)\\n- `dynamic-flow-executor.ts` - Executor implementation\\n- `run-agent-flow.ts` - Agent flow runner\\n- `__tests__/` - Flow tests\\n\\n### UI Components (`src/components/demo/`)\\n- `DynamicFlowsShowcase.tsx` - Main showcase component\\n- `FlowExecutor.tsx` - Flow executor UI\\n\\n### Demo Page (`src/app/demo/dynamic-flows/`)\\n- `page.tsx` - Demo page\\n\\n### Tests (Integration & E2E)\\n- `__tests__/e2e/flow-builder.e2e.test.ts`\\n- `__tests__/integration/flow-execution.integration.test.ts`\\n- `__tests__/performance/flow-benchmarks.test.ts`\\n- `app/api/__tests__/flows*.test.ts` - API tests\\n\\n### Migration Scripts (`scripts/migration/`)\\n- Flow analysis and migration tools\\n\\n## New Project Structure\\n\\n```\\ndynamic-flows-studio/\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 src/\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 ai/\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 dynamic-flow/          # Core library\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 flows/                 # Flow executors\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 schemas/               # Type definitions\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 lib/\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 cache/                 # Caching\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 models/                # Data models\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 utils/                 # Utilities\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 services/                  # Business logic\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 components/\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 flow/                  # Flow UI components\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 builder/               # Flow builder UI\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 executor/              # Executor UI\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 demo/                  # Demo components\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 app/\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 api/flows/             # API routes\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 api/admin/flows/       # Admin routes\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 builder/               # Flow builder page\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 demo/                  # Demo pages\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 layout.tsx             # Root layout\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 hooks/\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 flow/                  # Flow-specific hooks\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 api/                   # API hooks\\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 types/                     # Type definitions\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 __tests__/\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 e2e/\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 integration/\\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 unit/\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 docs/                          # Documentation\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 scripts/                       # Utilities\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 package.json\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 tsconfig.json\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 jest.config.js\\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 README.md\\n```\\n\\n## Implementation Steps\\n\\n### Phase 1: Create Project Structure (Step 1-2)\\n1. Create base directory: `/teamspace/studios/this_studio/dynamic-flows-studio`\\n2. Set up configuration files:\\n   - `package.json` (based on Arkan's with flow-focused dependencies)\\n   - `tsconfig.json`\\n   - `jest.config.js`\\n   - `next.config.ts`\\n   - `.eslintrc.json`\\n\\n### Phase 2: Copy Core Files (Step 3-5)\\n1. Copy dynamic-flow library (`src/ai/dynamic-flow/`)\\n2. Copy models and cache (`src/lib/models/flow-*.ts`, `src/lib/cache/flow-*`)\\n3. Copy services (`src/services/flow-*`)\\n4. Copy schemas (`src/ai/schemas/flows.ts`)\\n5. Copy executors and flows (`src/ai/flows/`)\\n\\n### Phase 3: Copy API Routes (Step 6-7)\\n1. Copy admin flows routes (`src/app/api/admin/flows/`)\\n2. Copy public flows routes (`src/app/api/flows/`)\\n\\n### Phase 4: Copy Components & UI (Step 8-9)\\n1. Copy demo components (`src/components/demo/`)\\n2. Copy demo pages (`src/app/demo/dynamic-flows/`)\\n3. Create new flow-specific UI components\\n\\n### Phase 5: Copy Tests (Step 10)\\n1. Copy all test files maintaining directory structure\\n2. Copy integration and E2E tests\\n\\n### Phase 6: Set Up & Configure (Step 11-13)\\n1. Install dependencies\\n2. Update imports and paths\\n3. Create shared utilities and hooks\\n\\n### Phase 7: Build Enhanced UI (Step 14-16)\\n1. Create Flow Builder component\\n2. Create Flow Executor component\\n3. Create Flow Management Dashboard\\n\\n### Phase 8: Documentation & Cleanup (Step 17-18)\\n1. Create project documentation\\n2. Remove all transferred files from Arkan\\n3. Update Arkan's imports if needed\\n\\n## Key Configuration Considerations\\n- Next.js 15.5.9 with TypeScript\\n- Jest for testing\\n- Shared UI components (shadcn/ui)\\n- Firebase integration for backend\\n- Genkit AI integration\\n- Tailwind CSS styling\\n\\n## Dependencies to Include\\n- All core dependencies from Arkan package.json\\n- Flow-specific libraries (@xyflow/react, reactflow)\\n- UI libraries (shadcn/ui, Radix UI)\\n- Testing libraries (Jest, Testing Library)\\n- Build tools (TypeScript, ESLint, Tailwind)\\n\\n## Cleanup After Migration\\n- Remove `src/ai/dynamic-flow/` from Arkan\\n- Remove flow configs from `src/lib/models/`\\n- Remove flow services from `src/services/`\\n- Remove flow schemas from `src/ai/schemas/`\\n- Remove flow routes from `src/app/api/`\\n- Remove demo components related to flows\\n- Remove flow tests from Arkan\\n- Update any Arkan imports that reference moved files\\n\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_012c2BkCJZVi2g5TmDTGcHHV", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
