dpoint\\n\\n### Flow Executors & Flows (`src/ai/flows/`)\\n- `dynamic-flow-executor.ts` - Executor implementation\\n- `run-agent-flow.ts` - Agent flow runner\\n- `__tests__/` - Flow tests\\n\\n### UI Components (`src/components/demo/`)\\n- `DynamicFlowsShowcase.tsx` - Main showcase component\\n- `FlowExecutor.tsx` - Flow executor UI\\n\\n### Demo Page (`src/app/demo/dynamic-flows/`)\\n- `page.tsx` - Demo page\\n\\n### Tests (Integration & E2E)\\n- `__tests__/e2e/flow-builder.e2e.test.ts`\\n- `__tests__/integration/flow-execution.integration.test.ts`\\n- `__tests__/performance/flow-benchmarks.test.ts`\\n- `app/api/__tests__/flows*.test.ts` - API tests\\n\\n### Migration Scripts (`scripts/migration/`)\\n- Flow analysis and migration tools\\n\\n## New Project Structure\\n\\n```\\ndynamic-flows-studio/\\n├── src/\\n│   ├── ai/\\n│   │   ├── dynamic-flow/          # Core library\\n│   │   ├── flows/                 # Flow executors\\n│   │   └── schemas/               # Type definitions\\n│   ├── lib/\\n│   │   ├── cache/                 # Caching\\n│   │   ├── models/                # Data models\\n│   │   └── utils/                 # Utilities\\n│   ├── services/                  # Business logic\\n│   ├── components/\\n│   │   ├── flow/                  # Flow UI components\\n│   │   ├── builder/               # Flow builder UI\\n│   │   ├── executor/              # Executor UI\\n│   │   └── demo/                  # Demo components\\n│   ├── app/\\n│   │   ├── api/flows/             # API routes\\n│   │   ├── api/admin/flows/       # Admin routes\\n│   │   ├── builder/               # Flow builder page\\n│   │   ├── demo/                  # Demo pages\\n│   │   └── layout.tsx             # Root layout\\n│   ├── hooks/\\n│   │   ├── flow/                  # Flow-specific hooks\\n│   │   └── api/                   # API hooks\\n│   └── types/                     # Type definitions\\n├── __tests__/\\n│   ├── e2e/\\n│   ├── integration/\\n│   └── unit/\\n├── docs/        