fig-service.test.ts\\n```\\n\\n### Flow Schemas\\n```\\nsrc/ai/schemas/flows.ts\\n```\\n\\n### Flow Executors\\n```\\nsrc/ai/flows/\\n├── dynamic-flow-executor.ts\\n├── run-agent-flow.ts\\n└── __tests__/\\n    ├── dynamic-flow-executor.test.ts\\n    ├── analysis-flows.test.ts\\n    ├── document-generation-flows.test.ts\\n    └── text-generation-flows.test.ts\\n```\\n\\n### API Routes\\n```\\nsrc/app/api/\\n├── admin/flows/\\n│   ├── route.ts\\n│   ├── [flowId]/route.ts\\n│   ├── [flowId]/versions/route.ts\\n│   └── execute/route.ts\\n├── flows/\\n│   ├── execute/route.ts\\n│   └── test/route.ts\\n└── __tests__/\\n    ├── admin-flows.test.ts\\n    ├── flows.test.ts\\n    └── flows-execute.test.ts\\n```\\n\\n### Demo Components\\n```\\nsrc/components/demo/\\n├── DynamicFlowsShowcase.tsx\\n├── FlowExecutor.tsx\\n└── FloatingParticles.tsx\\n```\\n\\n### Demo Pages\\n```\\nsrc/app/demo/dynamic-flows/page.tsx\\n```\\n\\n### Tests\\n```\\nsrc/__tests__/\\n├── e2e/flow-builder.e2e.test.ts\\n├── integration/flow-execution.integration.test.ts\\n└── performance/flow-benchmarks.test.ts\\n```\\n\\n## Import Updates Required in Arkan\\n\\nAfter removing the flow-related files, check the following files in Arkan for imports that may need updating:\\n\\n1. `src/ai/flows/index.ts` - Remove flow executor exports\\n2. `src/services/index.ts` - Remove flow-config-service export\\n3. `src/lib/models/index.ts` - Remove flow-config export\\n4. `src/ai/schemas/index.ts` - Update flows schema import\\n5. API route files that reference flow endpoints\\n6. Component files that import flow components\\n\\n## New Project Features\\n\\nThe Dynamic Flows Studio includes new UI components specifically designed for this standalone version:\\n\\n### New Components Built\\n- **Flow Builder** (`components/builder/FlowBuilder.tsx`): Visual node-based flow editor\\n- **Flow Node Panel** (`components/builder/FlowNodePanel.tsx`): Node type selector\\n- **Home Page** (`app/page.tsx`): Landing page with fea