emo pages\\necho \\\"Removing flow demo pages from src/app/demo/...\\\"\\nrm -rf src/app/demo/dynamic-flows/\\n\\n# Remove flow tests\\necho \\\"Removing flow-related tests from src/__tests__/...\\\"\\nrm -f src/__tests__/e2e/flow-builder.e2e.test.ts\\nrm -f src/__tests__/integration/flow-execution.integration.test.ts\\nrm -f src/__tests__/performance/flow-benchmarks.test.ts\\n\\necho \\\"\\\"\\necho \\\"==================================================\\\"\\necho \\\"Cleanup completed successfully!\\\"\\necho \\\"==================================================\\\"\\necho \\\"\\\"\\necho \\\"Next steps:\\\"\\necho \\\"1. Update imports in Arkan that reference the removed files\\\"\\necho \\\"2. Run tests to ensure nothing is broken: npm run test\\\"\\necho \\\"3. Update documentation if needed\\\"\\necho \\\"4. Commit changes with message: 'refactor: remove Dynamic Flows to standalone studio'\\\"\\necho \\\"\\\"\\n\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01YKCFwghjW7W5BoECjUDRaY", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
