ocalhost:3000/builder\\n3. Read: [docs/QUICK_START_DYNAMIC_FLOWS.md](./docs/QUICK_START_DYNAMIC_FLOWS.md)\\n4. Explore: [Demo](http://localhost:3000/demo)\\n\\n### \\\"I want to understand the migration\\\"\\n1. Read: [MIGRATION_SUMMARY.md](../MIGRATION_SUMMARY.md) (in parent directory)\\n2. Read: [MIGRATION.md](./MIGRATION.md)\\n3. Check: [VERIFICATION.md](./VERIFICATION.md)\\n\\n### \\\"I want to run tests\\\"\\n1. Setup: `npm install`\\n2. Run: `npm run test`\\n3. Watch: `npm run test:watch`\\n4. Coverage: `npm run test:coverage`\\n\\n### \\\"I want to deploy\\\"\\n1. Build: `npm run build`\\n2. Test: `npm start`\\n3. Configure: `.env.local` with Firebase\\n4. Deploy: To your hosting platform\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcd6 Directory Structure Guide\\n\\n```\\ndynamic-flows-studio/\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 README.md ..................... Start here! Setup and overview\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 COMPLETION_REPORT.md .......... Migration details and statistics\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 VERIFICATION.md .............. Verification checklist\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 MIGRATION.md ................. Detailed migration guide\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 INDEX.md ..................... This file\\n\u2502\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 src/\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 ai/dynamic-flow/ ......... Core execution engine (9 modules)\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 services/ ............... Business logic services\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 components/\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 builder/ ............ NEW: Flow builder UI\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 demo/ .............. Demo components\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 ui/ ................ UI library\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 app/\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 api/ ............... API routes (9 endpoints)\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 builder/ ........... Builder page\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 demo/ ............. Demo page\\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 page.tsx ........... Home page\\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 __tests__/ ............. Test files\\n\u2502\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 docs/\\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 dynamic-flows.md ........ Feature documentation\\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 QUICK_START_DYNAMIC_FLOWS.md .... Quick start\\n\u2502\\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 scripts/\\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 migration/ ............. Migration utilities\\n\u2502\\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 Configuration Files\\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 package.json ........... Dependencies (110+)\\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 tsconfig.json ......... TypeScript config\\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 next.config.ts ....... Next.js config\\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 jest.config.js ....... Jest config\\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 tailwind.config.ts ... Styling config\\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 .eslintrc.json ....... Code quality\\n```\\n\\n## \ud83d\udd0d Key Files Explained\\n\\n### Configuration\\n- **package.json** - Defines all dependencies and scripts\\n- **tsconfig.json** - TypeScript configuration with @ path alias\\n- **next.config.ts** - Next.js 15 optimization settings\\n- **jest.config.js** - Test runner configuration\\n\\n### Source Code\\n- **src/ai/dynamic-flow/** - Core flow execution engine\\n- **src/services/** - Business logic (flow-config-service)\\n- **src/components/builder/** - NEW visual flow builder\\n- **src/app/api/** - REST API endpoints\\n- **src/app/[pages]/** - Next.js pages\\n\\n### Testing\\n- **src/__tests__/** - Test files (e2e, integration, performance)\\n- **jest.setup.js** - Test environment setup\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcda Documentation Files\\n\\n### README.md (250+ lines)\\n- Project overview\\n- Installation steps\\n- Available commands\\n- Project structure\\n- Feature description\\n- API endpoints\\n- Support information\\n\\n### COMPLETION_REPORT.md (500+ lines)\\n- Executive summary\\n- Migration statistics\\n- Detailed file listings\\n- Technology stack\\n- Validation checklist\\n- Performance metrics\\n- Future enhancements\\n\\n### MIGRATION.md (400+ lines)\\n- Component listing\\n-