2514\u2500\u2500 Public: /api/flows/*\\n```\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcca Statistics at a Glance\\n\\n- **Total Files**: 100+\\n- **Source Code**: ~10,000 lines\\n- **Test Files**: 19\\n- **Components**: 50+\\n- **API Routes**: 9\\n- **Dependencies**: 110+\\n- **Test Coverage**: Comprehensive\\n\\n## \u26a1 Common Issues & Solutions\\n\\n### Issue: Port 3000 already in use\\n```bash\\nnpm run dev -- -p 3001\\n```\\n\\n### Issue: Dependencies not installed\\n```bash\\nnpm install\\n# or\\npnpm install\\n```\\n\\n### Issue: TypeScript errors\\n```bash\\nnpm run typecheck\\n```\\n\\n### Issue: Tests failing\\n```bash\\nnpm run test:watch\\n```\\n\\n## \ud83c\udd98 Getting Help\\n\\n### Check These First\\n1. [README.md](./README.md) - Setup issues\\n2. [docs/QUICK_START_DYNAMIC_FLOWS.md](./docs/QUICK_START_DYNAMIC_FLOWS.md) - Quick reference\\n3. Test files - See implementation examples\\n4. [VERIFICATION.md](./VERIFICATION.md) - Troubleshooting section\\n\\n### If Still Stuck\\n1. Check error messages carefully\\n2. Review relevant documentation section\\n3. Check test files for examples\\n4. Review similar components\\n\\n## \ud83c\udfaf Next Steps\\n\\n### To Start Development\\n```bash\\ncd dynamic-flows-studio\\nnpm install\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\n### To Learn More\\n- Read [README.md](./README.md)\\n- Check [docs/dynamic-flows.md](./docs/dynamic-flows.md)\\n- Explore source code in `src/`\\n\\n### To Deploy\\n- Build: `npm run build`\\n- Test: `npm start`\\n- Configure environment\\n- Deploy to platform\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcde Quick Reference\\n\\n| Need | Go To |\\n|------|-------|\\n| Setup help | [README.md](./README.md) |\\n| Quick start | [docs/QUICK_START_DYNAMIC_FLOWS.md](./docs/QUICK_START_DYNAMIC_FLOWS.md) |\\n| Architecture | [docs/dynamic-flows.md](./docs/dynamic-flows.md) |\\n| Migration details | [MIGRATION.md](./MIGRATION.md) |\\n| Summary | [COMPLETION_REPORT.md](./COMPLETION_REPORT.md) |\\n| Verification | [VERIFICATION.md](./VERIFICATION.md) |\\n| Examples 