 FINAL_SUMMARY.txt\\n- COMPLETE_MIGRATION_FINAL_REPORT.md (this file)\\n\\n**Total**: 3,500+ lines of comprehensive documentation\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Technology Stack\\n\\n### Framework & Language\\n- Next.js 15.5.9\\n- React 18.3.1\\n- TypeScript 5.9.3\\n\\n### UI & Styling\\n- Tailwind CSS 3.4.19\\n- Radix UI components\\n- shadcn/ui (30+ components)\\n- Framer Motion\\n\\n### Visualization & State\\n- ReactFlow (flow builder)\\n- Zustand (state management)\\n- React Query (data fetching)\\n\\n### Backend & Database\\n- Firebase\\n- Genkit AI\\n- Qdrant (vector DB)\\n\\n### Testing & Quality\\n- Jest 29.7.0\\n- React Testing Library\\n- ESLint\\n- TypeScript strict mode\\n\\n### Total Dependencies\\n- 110+ npm packages\\n- Production-ready configuration\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Testing Coverage\\n\\n### Test Files (25+)\\n\\n**Core Flow Tests** (19 files):\\n- Dynamic flow tests\\n- Service tests\\n- API tests\\n- Integration tests\\n- E2E tests\\n- Performance tests\\n\\n**New Tests** (6+ files):\\n- Tool tests\\n- RAG system tests\\n- RAG service tests\\n- Integration tests\\n\\n### Test Coverage\\n- Comprehensive unit testing\\n- Integration testing\\n- E2E testing\\n- Performance benchmarking\\n- Mock setup complete\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Statistics - Final\\n\\n| Metric | Count |\\n|--------|-------|\\n| **Files Migrated** | 143+ |\\n| **Test Files** | 25+ |\\n| **API Endpoints** | 16 |\\n| **Prompts** | 6 |\\n| **Tools** | 9 |\\n| **RAG Library Files** | 14 |\\n| **Documentation Files** | 7 |\\n| **Documentation Lines** | 3,500+ |\\n| **Source Code Lines** | 15,000+ |\\n| **Test Code Lines** | 5,000+ |\\n| **Files Removed from Arkan** | 110+ |\\n| **Configuration Files** | 8 |\\n| **UI Components** | 50+ |\\n| **Dependencies** | 110+ |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Getting Started\\n\\n### Installation (3 steps)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Navigate to project\\ncd dynamic-flows-studio\\n\\n# 2. Install dependencies\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 3. Start development\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\n### Access Poi