## 🎉 Complete Summary: Report Mode Scroller Improvements

I've successfully completed a **comprehensive overhaul** of the scrolling experience across all report mode components. Here's what was delivered:

### 📦 What Was Implemented

**7 Files Modified/Created:**

1. **`scroll-area.tsx`** - Enhanced with better scrollbars (3px, improved contrast, hover effects)
